BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Relaxed Screening: Hard Truths
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20250210T110000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20250210T124000
DTSTAMP:20250210T110000Z
UID:55838
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 1h 37m (97 mins)\nScreen 2\n\nAd and Trailer Free: N
 o advertisements or trailers will play ahead of this screening. You are re
 commended to arrive promptly.\n\nSubtitled (Captioned): Everyone welcome. 
 This screening has subtitles for people with hearing loss.\n\nRelaxed: Des
 igned to make cinema-going easier for those needing additional support\, i
